WEBVTT

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:45.850
Hey.

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:51.110
Could we study that Mask at the SSC?

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.190
Yeah, go ahead.

00:02:18.840 --> 00:02:19.680
Cute kid.

00:02:20.390 --> 00:02:21.220
Yeah.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:13.730
Do it again!

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:39.760
Look, Mommy!

00:03:52.520 --> 00:03:55.520
Why don't we put that pretty rock
you found in here?

00:04:15.330 --> 00:04:16.250
So, this is it.

00:04:19.380 --> 00:04:21.670
This place is being targeted.

00:04:22.880 --> 00:04:24.130
If I were targeting it...

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:39.650
<i>That's the car.</i>

00:04:41.650 --> 00:04:42.610
<i>Who's he?</i>

00:04:56.500 --> 00:04:57.630
<i>Intruder confirmed.</i>

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:02.090
<i>James? Why?</i>

00:05:03.010 --> 00:05:04.380
<i>Pull back immediately!</i>

00:05:08.140 --> 00:05:10.890
<i>So, he's with the SSC, too.</i>

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:25.010
That's great.

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:28.050
Let Theo know.

00:06:29.050 --> 00:06:30.300
His family is safe.

00:06:30.720 --> 00:06:31.890
Okay, I will!

00:06:33.010 --> 00:06:35.810
Backup should be getting here soon.
We're in the clear.

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:37.810
They're all home.

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:47.360
-We're almost back to the station.
-Eddy!

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:49.740
Don't let your guard down!

00:06:49.990 --> 00:06:51.320
I know, I know.

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:55.740
James.

00:06:57.790 --> 00:07:00.250
This Mask Theo has.

00:07:01.920 --> 00:07:03.130
Did...?

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.630
Grimm had one, too.

00:07:08.380 --> 00:07:11.010
So, all that strange phenomenon...

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:13.140
Yes.

00:07:15.850 --> 00:07:18.350
What were they planning to do with them?

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:22.520
<i>Eddy. Eddy!</i>

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:27.730
Grimm...

00:07:34.280 --> 00:07:36.280
Suddenly aged rapidly?

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:49.420
We just need to get to the SSC.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:52.590
If we're able to study you,
we can solve everything.

00:08:02.100 --> 00:08:03.600
<i>I will now secure the subject.</i>

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.740
<i>The number you have dialed</i>
<i>cannot be reached.</i>

00:08:12.280 --> 00:08:13.320
Damn it!

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:00.080
Hey.

00:09:11.130 --> 00:09:12.010
What's wrong?

00:09:12.920 --> 00:09:15.380
I don't know. I'm going to take a look.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:38.450
Are you okay?

00:09:38.530 --> 00:09:39.990
Be careful.

00:09:43.410 --> 00:09:44.250
Hey, Eddy!

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:47.420
Don't let your guard down.

00:09:49.710 --> 00:09:51.040
Eddy!

00:10:14.530 --> 00:10:15.360
Watch out!

00:10:41.470 --> 00:10:42.300
Oh, my God.

00:10:50.150 --> 00:10:51.400
Hey, Theo!

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:08.750
Theo! Theo!

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:13.540
Theo!

00:11:27.100 --> 00:11:28.730
Looks like I'm fine.

00:11:35.690 --> 00:11:36.520
Theo.

00:11:37.400 --> 00:11:38.280
You are not...

00:11:39.030 --> 00:11:39.900
one of them.

00:12:03.720 --> 00:12:05.090
-Hurry!
-Yeah.

00:12:11.180 --> 00:12:13.100
Sending you the subject's escape route.

00:13:03.740 --> 00:13:04.570
Theo!

00:13:05.360 --> 00:13:06.280
Eddy--

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:09.700
-Damn it!
-Theo!

00:13:10.030 --> 00:13:11.740
He's reaching the limit.

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:31.350
Oh, no!

00:13:32.270 --> 00:13:33.100
Theo!

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:26.990
You haven't changed.

00:14:28.820 --> 00:14:29.700
Tell me why.

00:14:32.080 --> 00:14:34.580
You wouldn't understand.

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:38.370
Theo! Theo! Are you okay?

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:43.880
No...

00:14:44.250 --> 00:14:45.380
I'm sorry.

00:14:46.550 --> 00:14:47.840
It looks like...

00:14:48.550 --> 00:14:49.880
I won't be able to help you.

00:14:50.720 --> 00:14:51.680
That's not...

00:14:54.140 --> 00:14:56.970
Give this to my family.

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:03.560
Don't give up yet!

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:14.580
Harry!

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:57.620
<i>Theo.</i>

00:15:58.660 --> 00:16:00.500
<i>Daddy! Daddy!</i>

00:16:01.410 --> 00:16:03.750
Eddy. Eddy.

00:16:05.840 --> 00:16:07.460
Theo, we're almost there.

00:16:08.170 --> 00:16:10.170
You'll be able to see your family.

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:13.800
This is it for me.

00:16:15.510 --> 00:16:17.220
I don't think...

00:16:25.310 --> 00:16:26.230
Eddy.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:29.730
My family...

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:34.660
Tell my family...

00:16:45.880 --> 00:16:47.380
Sending you the rendezvous point.

00:16:47.460 --> 00:16:49.000
Have a rifle ready.

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:55.760
<i>The number you have dialed</i>
<i>cannot be reached.</i>

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:09.150
<i>Theo...</i>

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:14.030
<i>Daddy.</i>

00:17:50.230 --> 00:17:51.270
Eleanor.

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:53.650
May.

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:11.040
It's my turn now...

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:15.300
May?

00:18:43.240 --> 00:18:45.290
Are you okay, mister?

00:19:01.930 --> 00:19:03.260
Are you okay?

00:19:06.970 --> 00:19:07.810
Yes.

00:19:09.480 --> 00:19:10.310
That's good!

00:19:38.550 --> 00:19:39.630
It's for me?

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:47.640
Thank you!

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:51.890
May.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:02.990
Mommy, look!

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:05.950
-See!
-It's very pretty.

00:20:23.090 --> 00:20:23.930
<i>Daddy!</i>

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:25.220
<i>Theo.</i>

00:20:42.990 --> 00:20:43.820
Well?

00:20:45.160 --> 00:20:46.490
Subject secured.

00:20:46.990 --> 00:20:48.580
He's already dead

00:20:48.660 --> 00:20:50.040
<i>from rapidly aging.</i>

00:20:54.460 --> 00:20:55.290
<i>Okay.</i>

00:21:00.760 --> 00:21:02.170
They got us again.

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:09.010
I can't even find where they took him.

00:21:09.100 --> 00:21:09.970
Damn it!

00:21:17.810 --> 00:21:18.900
I met Harry.

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:22.070
Grimm's body being taken,

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:23.820
the attack on Theo...

00:21:24.610 --> 00:21:26.740
he's involved with everything.

00:21:28.990 --> 00:21:29.830
Why?

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:47.360
Damn it!

00:24:19.410 --> 00:24:21.910
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
